<BaseLayout title="School Life | SCHOOL NAME" lang="en" description="Discover student life and the school experience at SCHOOL NAME."><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><p>Beyond the classroom</p><h1>A school experience built around learning, belonging and growth</h1><span>Replace this text with the new school’s approved description of student life, activities and community.</span></div></section><section class="intro wrap"><div><p class="kicker">The student experience</p><h2>Learning happens throughout the school day</h2></div><p>Describe the school’s verified approach to student experience, participation, wellbeing and activities here.</p></section><section class="life-photos wrap" aria-label="School life photographs"><figure class="life-main"><img src="/images/school/06-team-activity.jpg" alt="Replace with a genuine school photograph" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><b>PHOTO CAPTION</b><span>Replace with an approved description.</span></figcaption></figure><div class="life-side"><figure><img src="/images/school/09-sports-activity.jpg" alt="Replace with a genuine school photograph" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><b>PHOTO CAPTION</b><span>Replace with an approved description.</span></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/school/08-girls-acrobatics.jpg" alt="Replace with a genuine school photograph" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><b>PHOTO CAPTION</b><span>Replace with an approved description.</span></figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="cards wrap"><article><h3>Learning & discovery</h3><p>Customize this card using verified information from the new school.</p></article><article><h3>Language & communication</h3><p>Customize this card to match the school’s actual language environment.</p></article><article><h3>Belonging & wellbeing</h3><p>Add the school’s verified approach to belonging, wellbeing and student support.</p></article><article><h3>Activities & participation</h3><p>Add only activities and opportunities actually offered by the school.</p></article></section><section class="gallery-cta"><div class="wrap"><div><p class="kicker">See the school in action</p><h2>Explore moments from SCHOOL NAME</h2></div><a href="/gallery/">Visit the school gallery →</a></div></section><section class="visit"><div class="wrap"><h2>Interested in joining our school community?</h2><p>Replace with the school’s approved admissions invitation and verified grade range.</p><a class="btn-primary" href="/admissions/">Start an admission enquiry</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{background:linear-gradient(rgba(4,34,62,.72),rgba(4,34,62,.8)),url('/images/hero-2.jpg') center/cover;color:#fff;padding:105px 0}.hero p,.kicker{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700;color:#d5a43f}.hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(38px,5.5vw,60px);line-height:1.08;max-width:850px;margin:10px 0 18px}.hero span{display:block;max-width:680px;color:#e1eaf2;font-size:17px}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;padding-top:78px;padding-bottom:42px}.intro h2,.gallery-cta h2,.visit h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:32px;color:var(--navy-dark);line-height:1.2;margin-top:8px}.intro>p{color:var(--slate);font-size:16px}.life-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;grid-template-rows:auto;gap:18px;align-items:stretch;padding-bottom:62px}.life-main{height:100%}.life-photos .life-main img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top}.life-side{display:grid;grid-template-rows:minmax(0,45fr) minmax(0,55fr);gap:18px;height:100%;min-height:0}.life-photos figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;background:#eef3f7;box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(4,34,62,.1)}.life-side figure{min-height:0}.life-side img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;transition:transform .35s ease}.life-main img{display:block;transition:transform .35s ease}.life-photos figure:hover img{transform:scale(1.02)}.life-photos figcaption{position:absolute;left:14px;right:14px;bottom:14px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(4,34,62,.88);color:#fff;backdrop-filter:blur(5px)}.life-photos figcaption b,.life-photos figcaption span{display:block}.life-photos figcaption b{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px}.life-photos figcaption span{margin-top:3px;color:#e1eaf2;font-size:13px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;padding-bottom:80px}.cards article{background:var(--cream);border:1px solid #e6eaee;border-radius:12px;padding:30px}.cards h3{font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--navy-dark);font-size:22px;margin:0 0 9px}.cards p{color:var(--slate);font-size:14px}.gallery-cta{background:#eef3f7;padding:62px 0}.gallery-cta .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.gallery-cta a{color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.visit{background:var(--navy-dark);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:75px 0}.visit h2{color:#fff;font-size:36px}.visit p{color:#dce7f4;max-width:620px;margin:13px auto 25px}@media(max-width:700px){.hero{padding:72px 0}.intro,.cards,.life-photos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.intro{padding-top:55px;padding-bottom:35px}.life-photos{padding-bottom:50px}.life-main{height:auto}.life-photos .life-main img{height:auto;object-fit:initial}.life-side{grid-template-rows:none;gap:24px;height:auto}.life-side figure{height:auto}.life-side img{height:auto;object-fit:initial}.cards{padding-bottom:55px}.gallery-cta .wrap{display:block}.gallery-cta a{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px}.visit{padding:58px 0}}
</style>